%% States of a background job of a repo (src/repos/repo_jobs.py), kept in
%% DATA_FOLDER/user/<username>/jobs/<kind>.json, with a lock file while it runs
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> none
    none --> running: POST /user/repo/kind
    running --> done: zip ready, push or pull ended
    running --> failed: error, REPO_JOB_TIMEOUT, size limit
    running --> failed: process ended without its lock (interrupted)
    done --> running: started again after JOB_INTERVAL
    failed --> running: started again after JOB_INTERVAL
    done --> none: zip expired (REPO_ZIP_RETENTION) or new version of the repo
